# Do not restart running apps

Never restart, stop, kill, or relaunch the trader or the dashboard. Do not open or drive the app in the browser to restart or reload it.

When a change needs a running process to pick it up, stop and ask the user to do it. Say which process and why.

```text
The trader is still on the old code. Restart it when you can (`python main.py` in `trader/`) so this takes effect.
```

Code edits, tests, and database reads are fine. Starting a process that is not already running is fine only when the user asked for it.
